  "travel_tips": [
    "Register for Char Dham Yatra at uttarakhandtourism.gov.in — mandatory biometric registration",
    "Carry warm layers even in summer above 2000m — temperatures drop sharply after sunset",
    "Book GMVN (Garhwal Mandal Vikas Nigam) guesthouses for budget stays at major sites",
    "Best budget accommodation: GMVN tourist bungalows at ₹600–1500/night at most pilgrimage sites",
    "Altitude sickness risk above 3000m — ascend slowly and stay hydrated",
    "Many roads close Nov–Apr due to snowfall — always check BSNL road status or uttarakhandtourism.gov.in",
    "Hire local guides through official tourism counters at major sites to avoid unauthorized operators"
  ]
